# Privacy Policy

This website is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with Hermitcraft or its members. It is an unofficial redesign of the [hermitcraft.com](https://hermitcraft.com) website.

## What We Collect

We do not offer user accounts, sign-in, comments, or user uploads.

- We do **not** collect names, emails, passwords, or other account/profile data.
- We do **not** request access to your personal YouTube or Twitch account data.
- We do **not** access private account data from YouTube or Twitch.

## Cookies and Similar Technologies

[{siteConfig.url}]({siteConfig.url}) stores a single first-party cookie named `hc_user_config` for appearance-related preferences.

- Purpose: save appearance/UI preferences.
- Example values stored: `onlyHermitCraft` and `sidebarOpen`.
- Lifetime: up to 1 year (`max-age=31536000`).
- Scope: same-site usage on this website only.

We do not use this cookie for advertising, analytics profiling, or cross-site tracking. We do not place third-party tracking cookies.

## Security & Abuse Prevention

We process IP addresses to protect our services from abuse, fraud, and excessive requests (for rate limiting).

- IP addresses are stored in Redis cache for 60 seconds.
- Redis automatically deletes rate-limit entries after the 60-second window.
- IP addresses are not used for advertising or profiling.

## YouTube Client API

[{siteConfig.url}]({siteConfig.url}) uses a YouTube API Client that utilizes YouTube API Services. By using [{siteConfig.url}]({siteConfig.url}), users are agreeing to be bound by the [YouTube Terms of Service](https://www.youtube.com/t/terms).

The API Client only queries a predefined list of approximately 25 Hermitcraft-related YouTube channels.

The API Client accesses and stores **public YouTube API Data** for those channels and their public videos, including:

- Channel data (for example: channel ID, channel name, handle/custom URL, description, avatar/banner URLs, public subscriber/video/view counts, channel join date).
- Video data (for example: video ID, channel ID, title, thumbnail URL, publish date, duration, public view/like/comment counts, privacy/upload status provided by the API, livestream metadata).

This information is used only to display YouTube-related content on this website. We do not sell this data and do not share it with third parties for advertising.

We do not collect user-specific YouTube account data from visitors of this site.

[YouTube Terms of Service](https://www.youtube.com/t/terms)

[Google Privacy Policy](https://www.google.com/policies/privacy)

## Twitch Client API

[{siteConfig.url}]({siteConfig.url}) uses a Twitch API Client that utilizes Twitch API Services. By using [{siteConfig.url}]({siteConfig.url}), users are agreeing to be bound by the [Twitch Terms of Service](https://legal.twitch.com/legal/terms-of-service/).

The API Client uses a predefined list of channels in this project (approximately 25 total entries, including Twitch account mappings where available).

The API Client accesses and stores Twitch-related data used by this site, including:

- Configured channel mappings (for example: Twitch user ID and Twitch login) from this project's predefined channel list.
- Public live status checks from Twitch API responses (stored as whether a channel is currently live).

This information is used only to display Twitch-related content and live indicators on this website. We do not sell this data and do not share it with third parties for advertising.

We do not collect user-specific Twitch account data from visitors of this site.

[Twitch Terms of Service](https://legal.twitch.com/legal/terms-of-service/)

[Twitch Privacy Policy](https://legal.twitch.com/legal/privacy-notice/)

## Contact Information

Contact the site maintainer through the appropriate channel:

